Add minimal ccan config.h for standalone compilation.

The ccan library requires a config.h that is normally
generated by the ccan build system. We provide a minimal
version with endianness defines.

--- /dev/null
+++ b/lib/ccan/config.h
@@ -0,0 +1,2 @@
+#define HAVE_LITTLE_ENDIAN 1
+#define HAVE_BIG_ENDIAN 0
